        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CARBEL, Carre Rose with Bellagio Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bellagio Lever with Carre Rose has a retro style that adds classic elegance to this leverset, making it a great choice for traditional homes. It is available in a wide array of finishes. The Carre Short Plate with Bellagio Lever will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur CARBEL Bellagio Lever with Carre Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Carre Short Plate with Bellagio Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4.75</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CARBEL-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262386\" target=\"new\"><b> Grandeur CARBEL Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working levers. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Bellagio Lever with Carre Rose",
                "description": "The Bellagio Lever with Carre Rose has a retro style that adds classic elegance to this leverset, making it a great choice for traditional homes. It is available in a wide array of finishes. The Carre Short Plate with Bellagio Lever will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
